    "plain_text": "Aurelio De Laurentiis is an Italian film producer and football-club owner. He co-founded Filmauro with his father, building a vertically integrated production, distribution and cinema business with a catalogue exceeding 400 films. As owner and president of SSC Napoli, he restored the bankrupt club to Italy’s top division and presided over championship success.",
